{"version":1,"key":"card:229","content":{"id":229,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6913ac1c-b15c-450c-b1b5-94c2cba4f17f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每一个函数中都会有一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"arguments"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象，其中保存的是传入的参数值。"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"arguments"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象在严格和非严格模式下的行为是不同的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"02479f0a-433b-4366-82e0-64833943e3be","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在非严格模式下，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"arguments"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会受到命名参数的影响，即在函数内对命名参数进行修改，也会相应的对 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"arguments"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象产生修改"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"f46f964a-e135-4163-8956-4826747a2ba7","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"8f111cfc-5ceb-4761-bd3f-b4a36dc00046","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function getName(first, second) {\n  console.log(first === arguments[0]);  // true\n  console.log(second === arguments[1]); // true\n\n  first = \"a\";\n  second = \"b\";\n\n  console.log(first === arguments[0]);  // true\n  console.log(second === arguments[1]); // true\n}","collabId":"036c3614-d1c6-4a19-ad37-45d8f746f011","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ae26849c-0212-46bc-a4cd-010654d9a71e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在严格模式下，对命名参数的修改不会影响 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"arguments"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"d5e7caf5-37ad-4407-ac8a-f79cc388dfe4","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"66db1727-ce3a-446e-96ed-7b3bc9b00b91","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function getName(first, second = \"hello\") {\n    \"use strict\"\n    console.log(first === arguments[0]);  // true\n    console.log(second === arguments[1]); // true\n\n    first = 'a';\n    second = 'b';\n\n    console.log(first === arguments[0]);  // false\n    console.log(second === arguments[1]); // false\n}","collabId":"5b164c45-00a8-4a80-8c67-39814377dc05","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript"],"createTime":1690900627616,"updateTime":1743303640411,"linkedCards":[{"id":231,"target":{"key":"card:231","type":"card","id":231},"summary":"当我们调用函数时，传入的参数个数可以与定义函数时要求的函数个数不同，可多可少。所以传入的参数都会保存在 arguments 对象中，无论是在函数签名中已经定义了的参数(命名参数)还是未定义的参数(匿名参数) function print(a...","tags":["JavaScript"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640411}}